        <div class="accordion">
          <details class="accordion__item" open>
            <summary>What is 1XROLL Malaysia?</summary>
            <p>1XROLL is the brand behind online slots, live casino and mobile play for Malaysia players. <strong>1xrollslots.com</strong> is the official brand website for brand information, game guides and game entry. <strong>1xroll.my</strong> is the platform entry for registration, login, wallet and live play.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>How many games are available on 1XROLL?</summary>
            <p>1XROLL offers more than 1,187 games across categories including online slots, live casino, fast games, and fishing titles from studios such as Pragmatic Play, PG Soft, and Spribe.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>Does 1XROLL support mobile devices?</summary>
            <p>Yes. 1XROLL provides a responsive mobile website and a dedicated app for iOS and Android. Players can register, deposit, play games, and withdraw on smartphones and tablets. See our <a href="download-app/">download guide</a> for installation steps.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>How fast are withdrawals?</summary>
            <p>Withdrawals are processed quickly, with many requests completed in under fifteen minutes depending on the payment method. Malaysian banks, e-wallets, DuitNow, and cryptocurrency are supported for fast payouts.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>What providers are available on 1XROLL?</summary>
            <p>1XROLL features games from Pragmatic Play, PG Soft, Spribe, Evolution, Endorphina, JILI, Relax Gaming, Playson, and other leading studios. View the full <a href="providers/">providers list</a> for details.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>What is the welcome bonus?</summary>
            <p>New members can claim a 200% first deposit bonus up to 8,888 USDT with 25× turnover. Minimum first deposit is 10 USDT. See <a href="promotions/">all promotions</a> for full terms.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>What payment methods are accepted?</summary>
            <p>Maybank, CIMB, Public Bank, Touch 'n Go, GrabPay, Boost, DuitNow, and cryptocurrency (USDT, Bitcoin, Ethereum).</p>
          </details>
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>How can I contact customer support?</summary>
            <p>Support is available 24/7 via live chat on the website and Telegram. Average response time is under 2 minutes.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
